=== host subcommands (no old names) ===
add	Connect a host: check it, install the helper, prepare it
alerts	Show where a host sends alerts, and the last deliveries
create	Make a host with lima, docker or e2b, and connect it
doctor	Check a host's setup, and with --fix fix what it can
ls	List hosts
rekey	Replace a host's pinned SSH host key
restore	Start again the sessions that a host restart stopped
rm	Forget a host, and optionally delete its created machine
set	Change named settings of a host
show	Show a host's settings, sandbox levels and status
start	Start the host through its provider or provider script
status	Ask the provider or provider script whether the host is running
stop	Stop the host through its provider or provider script
test	Check that a host answers, and how fast
upgrade	Install or update this client's helper and runtime files on a host
:4

